<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Payment Successful</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
    <style>
        .success-box {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
            background: #e8f5e9;
            border: 1px solid #4CAF50;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .success-box h1 {
            color: #4CAF50;
            margin-top: 0;
        }
        pre {
            text-align: left;
            background: #f4f4f4;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            overflow-x: auto;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="success-box">
            <h1>✅ Payment Successful</h1>
            <p>Your transaction was completed successfully!</p>
        </div>

        <h3>Transaction Response Details</h3>
        <p>The following JSON payload was received from PayU:</p>
        <pre><%= JSON.stringify(data, null, 4) %></pre>

        <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">
            <a href="/" style="padding: 10px 20px; background-color: #007bff; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px;">Start New Transaction</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
